### **## Summary Table for your Notes**

| Concept | Simple Analogy |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Quotes** | Force the computer to read the text literally (no "smart" guessing). |
| **Environment** | Live settings for the container (like a volume knob). |
| **Network (Service Level)** | Telling a container which "room" to go into. |
| **Network (Top Level)** | Actually building the "room" itself. |

The Top-Level `networks:` section is basically the "Infrastructure" definition, while the one under the services is the "Assignment." 

